# Database Data Verification (QA — olshoperp-docs)

Pakai rule ini saat user / tugas menyebut **cek db**, **query db**, **db staging**, **db tyas**, **db merdian**, **audit trail db**, **verifikasi data di database**, atau saat FAIL E2E perlu bukti baris DB.

## Sumber kebenaran

| Layer | Lokasi | Isi |
|-------|--------|-----|
| **Kontrol QA (workspace ini)** | `tests/DATA-VERIFICATION.md` | Level L1/L2/L3, kapan boleh, matriks env, gate company_id |
| **SoT teknis runner** | `../olshoperp/.cursor/rules/19-database-debugger.mdc` | Read-only, forensik 4 langkah, larangan secret |
| **Mekanisme Eksekusi** | Direct HTTP POST (Webhook n8n) | Eksekusi via HTTP Request; kredensial dari `.env` |
| **Nama tabel (agent)** | `agent-db/cache.md` + `agent-db/README.md` | Menu → tabel, jebakan kolom, S0–S6, write-back |

Jangan menduplikasi prosedur panjang di sini — baca `tests/DATA-VERIFICATION.md` dulu, lalu rule 19 di `olshoperp` jika forensik mendalam.

## 0. Menu → tabel → kolom (wajib sebelum SELECT bisnis)

User menyebut **nama menu**, bukan `scm_`/`omni_`. Jangan tebak nama tabel/kolom. Detail + contoh: `agent-db/README.md`.

```
S0  Cari nama menu / kata user di agent-db/cache.md. Ketemu tabel → S4.
S1  Cheat di bawah. Ketemu tabel → S4.
S2  Prefix dari nama menu: PO/PR/inbound/outbound/transfer/System Product/warehouse → scm_ ·
    SO/store/wave/Manage Platform Product → omni_ · Journal/COA/invoice/payment/CN/DN/tax → accounting_ ·
    User/role → gate_ · Company → gs_
    Pengecualian: Sales Return & Purchase Return (Accounting/SCM) = scm_stock_mutations.
S3  SHOW TABLES LIKE '%keyword%' (saring prefix S2). Ambigu → DESCRIBE kandidat.
S4  DESCRIBE <tabel> 1×/tabel/sesi — wajib jika kolom belum tercatat di cache atau belum di-DESCRIBE. Wajib omni_sales_orders.
S5  SELECT hanya kolom dari DESCRIBE; company_id / deleted_at hanya jika ada.
    500 / Unknown column → STOP menebak → DESCRIBE → maks 1 retry.
S6  Belajar hal baru → write-back agent-db/cache.md + auto commit & push main (agent-db/README.md § S6).
```

Cheat: System Product → `scm_products` · Purchase Order → `scm_purchase_orders` · Purchase Inbound → `scm_stock_mutations` (bukan `type='in'`) · Journal → `accounting_journals` (bukan `acc_`) · CN/DN/Payment → `accounting_payments` + `type` · Sales Return Accounting/SCM → `scm_stock_mutations` · Sales Order → `omni_sales_orders` (DESCRIBE wajib) · User → `gate_users`.

- `status` = flag aktif 1/0; status dokumen = `transaction_status` (lowercase).
- `*_formatted` / Vue `*_id` bukan kolom. `requirement.md` = expected, bukan nama kolom.
- Jangan `olshoperp/docs/db-schema/` untuk nama kolom.

## Routing env & HTTP Request

DILARANG menjalankan runner script `.mjs` (`scripts/agent-db-query.mjs`). Eksekusi wajib langsung via **HTTP POST Request** ke Webhook n8n.

- **Tyas** (`tyas_olshoperp`) + **Staging** (`staging_olshoperp`) → webhook **shared**:
  * **URL**: `https://n8n.olshoperp.com/webhook/agent-db-tyas`
  * **Header**: `Content-Type: application/json`, `X-API-Key: <DB_DEBUG_API_KEY>`
- **Merdian** (`merdian_olshoperp`) → webhook **terpisah** (server beda):
  * **URL**: `https://n9n.olshoperp.com/webhook/agent-db-merdian`
  * **Header**: `Content-Type: application/json`, `X-API-Key: <DB_DEBUG_API_KEY_MERDIAN>`

Contoh eksekusi via HTTP Request (`curl`):

```bash
# Query Staging
curl -s -X POST "https://n8n.olshoperp.com/webhook/agent-db-tyas" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-API-Key: $DB_DEBUG_API_KEY" \
  -d '{"db":"staging_olshoperp","query":"DESCRIBE scm_products"}'

# Query Tyas
curl -s -X POST "https://n8n.olshoperp.com/webhook/agent-db-tyas" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-API-Key: $DB_DEBUG_API_KEY" \
  -d '{"db":"tyas_olshoperp","query":"SELECT id, sku FROM scm_products WHERE company_id = 153 AND deleted_at IS NULL LIMIT 5"}'

# Query Merdian
curl -s -X POST "https://n9n.olshoperp.com/webhook/agent-db-merdian" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-API-Key: $DB_DEBUG_API_KEY_MERDIAN" \
  -d '{"db":"merdian_olshoperp","query":"SELECT id, name FROM gate_users LIMIT 5"}'
```

## Larangan QA (mutlak)

1. Hasil DB **bukan** bukti `last_execution.status: passed` untuk TC UI-crawling.
2. Jangan expose `DB_DEBUG_API_KEY*` / URL override di chat, TC, atau commit.
3. Dilarang menggunakan runner script `.mjs` — wajib HTTP POST Request langsung ke Webhook.
4. Selalu filter scope **company** yang sedang diuji; SoftDeletes awareness.
5. Read-only saja — hanya `SELECT`, `EXPLAIN`, `DESCRIBE`, `SHOW`, `WITH`. Dilarang mutasi SQL (`INSERT`/`UPDATE`/`DELETE`/`DROP`).
6. Jangan buat folder `qa-docs/{menu}` khusus “cek DB” — tooling ops, bukan fitur menu.

## Triage cepat: Kapan DB vs Kapan LOG

| Permintaan User / Intent | Jalur Eksekusi | Tool & Rule |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Assert TC / flow UI lulus** | Playwright CLI (L1) | Rule `14` (`npm test`) |
| **Cek status data / kolom aktual** | Direct HTTP POST (DB Webhook) | Rule `19` |
| **Audit trail (siapa ubah data / void)** | Direct HTTP POST (DB `audits`) | Rule `19` |
| **Hitung data kuantitatif / anomali** | Direct HTTP POST (DB Agregasi `COUNT(*)`) | Rule `19` |
| **Error 500 / Exception / Crash Server** | Direct HTTP POST (Log Webhook) | Rule `21` |
| **Investigasi Error 2 Arah** | Log ➡️ DB Cross-check | HTTP Fetch Log dulu ➡️ HTTP Query DB record ID terkait |
